flowchart TB
  U[User question] --> I[Intent and scope]
  I --> K[Approved semantic metric/catalog]
  K --> E[Governed DAX/SQL execution]
  E --> V[Evidence envelope\nsource, as_of, quality]
  V --> N[Explanation / chart / artifact]
  N --> H[Human decision or next action]
  K -. unknown metric .-> F[Clarify or refuse]
  E -. DQ / permission / provider failure .-> F
  H -. consequential change .-> P[Separate approval and action gate]
